{"metadata":{"title":"Presenting in person","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both sides need ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription"},{"text":" in the app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. Bluetooth failures are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s; protocol failures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Share as the holder","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Share-as-the-holder"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" returns a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" whose ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show. It advertises until a reader connects, then reports","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with who is asking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Show ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" on the consent screen. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when its certificate chains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". An unsigned request could","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ends a session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ends a session at any point, as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder leaves the screen, say. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" sets how long it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Read as the verifier","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" needs no ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": give it the IACAs whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asking, a key in a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and its certificate chain, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader authentication extended key usage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"). ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, or nil if the holder declined.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(issuerRoots: issuerRoots))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            return mdoc","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" carries the disclosed elements, the document signer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the IACA it chains to, and its validity. Its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/statusList","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is unchecked: check it before relying on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the document.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presen